   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "harlequins"
   },
   "text": "Requirements:\n\n- Your army must include a Troupe Master equipped with a Jetbike.\n- Your army may not include any War Weavers or Harlequin Wraith Lords.\n- Your army must include at least 2 Sky Spinners.\n\nBenefits:\n\n- Sky Spinners in your army may be fielded as Troops choices but they gain the Support Squad special rule.\n- You may field Sky Weavers as Elites choices.\n- During deployment, select a single enemy unit in your opponent's army to be the \"Prize\". If that unit is removed from play, being slain or wrecked as a result of the Harlequin players actions, score an additional D3 VP at the conclusion of the Battle.",
